            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Texaco Inc., according to Texaco Inc., texaco argues that a joint venture is entitled to set and unify prices for its gasoline products and therefore the price\u2011unification is not unlawful."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Alioto",
        "citations": [
          {
