            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Alioto, the Government alleges that the price increase was 67\u202fpercent in major markets, suggesting an anticompetitive effect."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondents",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "01c128fd79f88b75b0d3b92e9ad4fe9fbc7fb0790faa009d716264a117d60543",
